406
00:29:22.830 --> 00:29:25.005
Ma olen

407
00:29:35.730 --> 00:29:38.055
Sama osas Elo

408
00:29:45.860 --> 00:29:48.035
Ma olen

409
00:29:51.230 --> 00:29:53.330
Aus.

410
00:29:54.240 --> 00:29:56.315
Ja.

411
00:29:56.730 --> 00:29:59.255
Kus mu äärest loodus?

412
00:31:14.650 --> 00:31:18.460
Aga tead, see ei ole tõsi,
